Description: Time series forecasting with an intuitionistic fuzzy artificial
    neural network. Lagged values of the series and their intuitionistic
    fuzzy membership and non-membership degrees, obtained by intuitionistic
    fuzzy c-means clustering, are used as inputs of a feed-forward neural
    network with one hidden layer, averaged over several random starts. The
    lag order and the network hyper-parameters (number of hidden neurons and
    weight decay) can be set manually or tuned automatically by grid search
    over user-defined minimum, maximum and step ranges, with time-ordered
    validation and a progress display. The intuitionistic fuzzy approach
    follows Yolcu and Yolcu (2023) <doi:10.1016/j.eswa.2022.119336>.
